.KEY VER/A
.BRA {
.KET }
;
; Build an AmiBinkD release archive for the file section.
;
;   Execute DH4:MakeAmiBinkd 10_31
;
; The version is an argument so this script does not have to be copied and
; edited for every release (it was MakeAmiBinkd1025 before, and the 10.25 in
; three places was easy to half-update).
;
; MUST RUN ON THE AMIGA. The Linux host's `lha' is Lhasa, which only
; EXTRACTS. Every previous release carries the [Amiga] OS byte, so it is
; built with DH0:C/lha to stay consistent.
;
; Layout, matching every release since v10.18:
;     AmiBinkD/  (binary, readme.txt, manual.txt, amibinkd-example.cfg,
;                 amibinkd.scr, AmiBinkD.info)
;     File_ID.DIZ
;
CD DH4:
Delete UDBase0:NETWORKING/AmiBinkd{VER}.lha QUIET
lha -r a UDBase0:NETWORKING/AmiBinkd{VER}.lha AmiBinkD File_ID.DIZ
Echo ""
Echo "Archive contents:"
lha l UDBase0:NETWORKING/AmiBinkd{VER}.lha
